NAME
    lean-hedgehog - property-based testing for Lean 4

IN MEMORY OF JACOB STANLEY
    This library is a tribute to Jacob Stanley, author and co-founder
    of Hedgehog.

    Jacob's passion for Haskell and his commitment to high-quality,
    reliable software shaped Hedgehog in countless ways.  Integrated
    shrinking, the idea this port is built around, is his: a generator
    carries its own shrinks, so a shrunk value obeys the invariants of
    the generator that made it.

    Jacob passed away unexpectedly on 9 April 2023.  His absence is
    deeply felt, but his impact on Hedgehog, and on those who had the
    privilege to work with him, remains.  lean-hedgehog continues that
    work in Lean, in his memory.

SEE ALSO
    https://github.com/hedgehogqa/haskell-hedgehog, the original.
